    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cupig's Key Collectathon</strong> is a simple game where you collect keys to open treasure chests.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999220/extras/6450c946191ec62c337a7a7402cdc7fe.poster.avif?t=1752549479\" width=610 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999220/extras/6450c946191ec62c337a7a7402cdc7fe.webm?t=1752549479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999220/extras/6450c946191ec62c337a7a7402cdc7fe.mp4?t=1752549479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main objective it to solve harder and harder levels finding the shortest way possible the fastest. If you fall you die but the timer continues to go on so be precise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >100Levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 100 harder and harder levels, visiting several worlds from sky islands to the deep sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be fast!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your time, be the fastest Pig to collect all the keys and treasure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cupig's Key Collectathon</strong> is a simple game where you collect keys to open treasure chests.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999220/extras/6450c946191ec62c337a7a7402cdc7fe.poster.avif?t=1752549479\" width=610 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999220/extras/6450c946191ec62c337a7a7402cdc7fe.webm?t=1752549479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999220/extras/6450c946191ec62c337a7a7402cdc7fe.mp4?t=1752549479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main objective it to solve harder and harder levels finding the shortest way possible the fastest. If you fall you die but the timer continues to go on so be precise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >100Levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 100 harder and harder levels, visiting several worlds from sky islands to the deep sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be fast!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your time, be the fastest Pig to collect all the keys and treasure!</p>",
    "short_description": "Be fast. Be precise. Collect all the keys and make Cupig rich! If you fall the timer does not restart, so if you want to beat records you have to be nifty! Cupig's Key Collectathon is fast!",
